1
00:00:00,037 --> 00:00:01,942
Ben Goes Fishing
本去钓鱼

2
00:00:05,477 --> 00:00:09,301
Ben and his dad went fishing
Ben和他爸爸去钓鱼了

3
00:00:10,996 --> 00:00:12,821
Ben took the pole
Ben拿了杆子

4
00:00:13,957 --> 00:00:17,262
His dad took some worms
他爸爸吃了些虫子

5
00:00:18,157 --> 00:00:20,382
They got on a boat
他们上了船

6
00:00:21,356 --> 00:00:24,542
The boat was in Pine Lake
船在松树湖

7
00:00:25,597 --> 00:00:29,102
Ben's dad drove the boat
Ben的爸爸开的船

8
00:00:30,157 --> 00:00:33,621
He knows where to find the fish
他知道鱼在哪

9
00:00:34,877 --> 00:00:38,182
Ben liked the boat ride
Ben喜欢坐船

10
00:00:40,076 --> 00:00:43,741
Ben put a worm on the hook
Ben在钩子上放了条虫子

11
00:00:44,957 --> 00:00:48,542
He put his line in the water
他把鱼线放到水里

12
00:00:49,796 --> 00:00:52,421
He felt the pole pull
他感觉到了杆子的拉力

13
00:00:53,436 --> 00:00:55,582
Was it a fish?
是鱼吗？

14
00:00:57,317 --> 00:01:00,101
He reeled it in
他把它卷了进来

15
00:01:01,356 --> 00:01:04,462
He did not get a fish
他没有得到一条鱼

16
00:01:05,277 --> 00:01:08,382
Ben got an old can
Ben有个旧罐子

